{"top": "<section class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-background flex items-center\" id=\"top\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><span class=\"inline-block relative h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40\" data-base44-image=\"\" data-base44-image-src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/6ac0b3b61be56657fe1147c1/dd4e7ec86_generated_defb9000.png\"><span class=\"block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"High-pressure water jetting nozzle emitting a concentrated needle-sharp stream of water against a dark textured background\" class=\"w-full h-full inset-0 absolute object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"{{BASE}}assets/2d58a3356859246734.webp\"/></span></span><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-background/70 via-background/60 to-background\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-24 right-6 lg:right-10 z-10 hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2.5 border border-border bg-background/60 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-2 rounded-sm\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-primary pulse-dot\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary\"></span></span><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Trotwood, OH <span class=\"text-primary\">/</span> Active Dispatch</span></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10 w-full pt-24 pb-20\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-primary\"></span>High-Pressure Pipe Restoration</div><h1 class=\"font-display font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] text-foreground text-balance\"><span class=\"block text-[clamp(3.5rem,14vw,12rem)]\">RESTORE</span><span class=\"block text-[clamp(3.5rem,14vw,12rem)] text-outline -mt-2\">FLOW</span></h1><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-12\"><p class=\"md:col-span-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl\">Trotwood Hydro Jetting Pros clears residential and commercial sewer and drain lines across Trotwood, Ohio with high-velocity water-jet technology . a non-invasive surgical intervention that scours, descales, and flushes pipe walls back to full capacity.</p><div class=\"md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9 flex flex-col gap-3 justify-end\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold px-6 py-4 rounded-sm hover:pressure-glow transition-all\" href=\"#contact\">Request Dispatch</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-border text-foreground font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold px-6 py-4 rounded-sm hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"#process\">The Process</a></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-border border border-border\"><div class=\"bg-background p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-primary\">Up to 4000</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mt-1\">PSI Operating Pressure</div></div><div class=\"bg-background p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-primary\">4–18\"</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Pipe Diameter Range</div></div><div class=\"bg-background p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-primary\">18 GPM</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Water Flow Rate</div></div><div class=\"bg-background p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-2xl font-semibold text-primary\">100%</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Pipe Wall Restoration</div></div></div></div></section>", "process": "<section class=\"relative py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-border\" id=\"process\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 mb-16\"><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-primary\"></span>Hydro-Kinetic Process</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]\">Three stages of water-jet restoration.</h2></div><p class=\"md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground self-end\">Hydro jetting is not snaking. Where a cable auger punches a path through a blockage, high-pressure water scours the entire interior wall . removing the cause, not just the symptom . and restoring full flow capacity to the line.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-px bg-border border border-border\"><article class=\"group bg-background p-8 lg:p-10 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-card\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 items-start\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-5xl font-semibold text-primary/30 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">01</div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-3\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Scrubbing</h3></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A forward-facing jetting nozzle directs high-velocity water streams that scour grease, sludge, and soft buildup off the interior pipe wall, breaking the bond between debris and pipe surface.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-3\">Removes: grease, soap scum, sludge, sand, soft organic buildup</div></div></div></article><article class=\"group bg-background p-8 lg:p-10 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-card\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 items-start\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-5xl font-semibold text-primary/30 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">02</div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-3\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Descaling</h3></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Specialized rotating nozzles deliver concentrated jets that fracture and strip hardened mineral scale and calcification from the pipe wall, restoring the original internal diameter.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-3\">Removes: mineral scale, calcium deposits, hardened buildup</div></div></div></article><article class=\"group bg-background p-8 lg:p-10 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-card\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 items-start\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-5xl font-semibold text-primary/30 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">03</div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-3\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Flushing</h3></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Rear-facing jets propel the nozzle forward while a high-volume water flow carries all dislodged debris downstream and out of the line, leaving a clean, fully flowing pipe.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-3\">Clears: dislodged debris, root fragments, sediment to the main</div></div></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-12 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] overflow-hidden border border-border\"><span class=\"inline-block relative h-full w-full object-cover\" data-base44-image=\"\" data-base44-image-src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/6ac0b3b61be56657fe1147c1/59c3a8d1b_generated_df6207ff.png\"><span class=\"block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Macro cross-section view of a clean steel pipe interior with a thin high-pressure water jet stream flushing through\" class=\"w-full h-full inset-0 absolute object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"{{BASE}}assets/8e7baf18c7bcfe5a17.webp\"/></span></span><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background/60 to-transparent\"></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-4\">Technical Note</p><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground\">The jetting nozzle travels the full length of the line under pressure, so every inch of interior wall is treated . not just the point of blockage. This is what separates hydro jetting from a cable auger pass.</p></div></div></div></section>", "why": "<section class=\"relative py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-border bg-card/30\" id=\"why\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 mb-16\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-primary\"></span>Why Hydro Jetting</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]\">The definitive, non-invasive solution.</h2></div><p class=\"md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground self-end\">For Trotwood homes and businesses dealing with recurring slow drains, greasy buildup, or root intrusion, hydro jetting addresses the root cause rather than clearing a path that closes back up.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-border\"><span class=\"inline-block relative h-full w-full object-cover\" data-base44-image=\"\" data-base44-image-src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/6ac0b3b61be56657fe1147c1/80a271ba3_generated_12ae0ea8.png\"><span class=\"block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Professional technical shot of a hydro jetting rig control panel with precision dials, pressure gauges and valves glowing in twilight\" class=\"w-full h-full inset-0 absolute object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"{{BASE}}assets/ad110d4e3386d309ea.webp\"/></span></span><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background/50 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground/80 bg-background/70 px-2 py-1\">Rig Control Panel / Live Pressure Readout</div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\"><div class=\"border border-border\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border\"><div class=\"p-4 bg-primary/10\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold\">Hydro Jetting</div></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-background\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Cable Snaking</div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border last:border-0\"><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-primary/5\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Scours entire pipe wall</span></div><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Punches a path through blockage</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border last:border-0\"><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-primary/5\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Removes grease, scale &amp; roots</span></div><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Leaves residue on pipe walls</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border last:border-0\"><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-primary/5\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Restores full internal diameter</span></div><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Partial flow often returns</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border last:border-0\"><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-primary/5\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Non-invasive . no chemicals</span></div><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">May require chemical follow-up</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border last:border-0\"><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-primary/5\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Treats the full line length</span></div><div class=\"p-4 flex items-start gap-2.5\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Treats only the blockage point</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>", "area": "<section class=\"relative py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-border\" id=\"area\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 mb-16\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-primary\"></span>Trotwood Infrastructure Hub</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]\">Built for Trotwood's subterranean lines.</h2></div><p class=\"md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground self-end\">Hydro jetting cleans the line from the inside, so the first question is where the blockage sits. Trotwood's <a href=\"https://trotwood.org/public-works-department/water-sewer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-content-link\" style=\"display:inline;margin:0\">Public Works water and sewer page</a> says the city utility crew maintains a lift station and 30.9 miles of wastewater collection lines, including flushing and clearing main lines. A blockage in the private line to the main is a separate job. Tell us which fixtures are affected before choosing a service.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12\"><aside class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-border\"><span class=\"inline-block relative h-full w-full object-cover opacity-60\" data-base44-image=\"\" data-base44-image-src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/6ac0b3b61be56657fe1147c1/100d8bb1c_generated_b03d07fd.png\"><span class=\"block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Cinematic wide-angle shot of a Trotwood Ohio residential street at dusk emphasizing the vanishing point where subterranean sewer lines run\" class=\"w-full h-full inset-0 absolute object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"{{BASE}}assets/488c35c7c5ad9f2521.webp\"/></span></span><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-background/50\"></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 62\"><g fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" stroke-width=\"0.2\"><line x1=\"50\" x2=\"50\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"62\"></line><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"31\" y2=\"31\"></line><line x1=\"25\" x2=\"35\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"62\"></line><line x1=\"75\" x2=\"65\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"62\"></line><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"20\"></line><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"47\" y2=\"42\"></line></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"1\" r=\"2.2\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.5\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" stroke-width=\"0.3\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"12\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"36\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"36\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"36\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g><g style=\"cursor:pointer\"><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"36\" fill=\"hsl(188 100% 50%)\" opacity=\"0.6\" r=\"1.4\" style=\"transition:0.2s\"></circle></g></svg><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground/70 bg-background/60 px-2 py-1\">Trotwood, OH / Sewer Corridor Grid</div></div></aside><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-border border border-border\"><button aria-label=\"Trotwood service information\" class=\"text-left p-4 transition-all bg-primary/10\" data-area-choice=\"0\">Trotwood</button><button aria-label=\"Single-family homes service information\" class=\"text-left p-4 transition-all bg-background hover:bg-card\" data-area-choice=\"1\">Single-family homes</button><button aria-label=\"Multi-unit properties service information\" class=\"text-left p-4 transition-all bg-background hover:bg-card\" data-area-choice=\"2\">Multi-unit properties</button><button aria-label=\"Residential properties service information\" class=\"text-left p-4 transition-all bg-background hover:bg-card\" data-area-choice=\"3\">Residential properties</button><button aria-label=\"Commercial properties service information\" class=\"text-left p-4 transition-all bg-background hover:bg-card\" data-area-choice=\"4\">Commercial properties</button></div><article class=\"mt-6 border border-border p-6 bg-card/40\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-2\">Selected Corridor</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4\">Trotwood</h3><dl class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 pb-3 border-b border-border\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Pipe Type</dt><dd class=\"text-sm text-foreground text-right\">Confirm by inspection</dd></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Application</dt><dd class=\"text-sm text-foreground text-right\">Cleaning after condition assessment</dd></div></dl></article></div></div></div></section>", "faq": "<section class=\"relative py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-border bg-card/30\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 mb-16\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-primary\"></span>Technical FAQ</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]\">The mechanics, explained.</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-px bg-border border border-border\"><div class=\"bg-background\"><button aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-6 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left\" data-faq-toggle=\"\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-primary/50\">01</span><span class=\"font-display text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">What is hydro jetting?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-96\"><p class=\"px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6 lg:pb-8 pl-16 lg:pl-20 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl\">Hydro jetting is a drain and sewer cleaning method that uses a high-pressure stream of water  directed through a specialized nozzle to scour the interior walls of a pipe. It removes grease, scale, sludge, and root intrusion without chemicals or excavation.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-background\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-6 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left\" data-faq-toggle=\"\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-primary/50\">02</span><span class=\"font-display text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">How is hydro jetting different from snaking?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6 lg:pb-8 pl-16 lg:pl-20 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl\">A cable snake punches a path through a blockage, but residue remains on the pipe walls and the clog often returns. Hydro jetting scours the entire interior surface, restoring the pipe's full internal diameter and removing the cause of the blockage . not just the symptom.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-background\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-6 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left\" data-faq-toggle=\"\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-primary/50\">03</span><span class=\"font-display text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Is hydro jetting safe for older pipes?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6 lg:pb-8 pl-16 lg:pl-20 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl\">Hydro jetting is effective across Trotwood's mix of historic clay tile, cast iron, and modern PVC lines. Water pressure is adjusted to the pipe material and condition. A line should be inspected first to confirm the pipe is structurally sound before high-pressure jetting is applied.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-background\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-6 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left\" data-faq-toggle=\"\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-primary/50\">04</span><span class=\"font-display text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">What pipe sizes can be hydro jetted?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6 lg:pb-8 pl-16 lg:pl-20 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl\">Hydro jetting is effective on residential and commercial lines ranging from roughly 4 inches up to 18 inches in diameter, covering most Trotwood home sewer laterals through larger commercial mains.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-background\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-6 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left\" data-faq-toggle=\"\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-primary/50\">05</span><span class=\"font-display text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Do you serve all of Trotwood?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6 lg:pb-8 pl-16 lg:pl-20 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl\">Availability must be confirmed for each address and request. We take requests about Trotwood, Ohio, including Westbrooke Village, Shiloh Springs Road, Main Street Corridor and the Salem Mall and Wolf Creek Pike area.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-background\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-6 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left\" data-faq-toggle=\"\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-primary/50\">06</span><span class=\"font-display text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">When should I request hydro jetting?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 lg:px-8 pb-6 lg:pb-8 pl-16 lg:pl-20 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl\">Hydro jetting is the right call for recurring slow drains, persistent grease buildup, mineral scale, root intrusion, or before a line inspection to ensure the camera can see the true condition of the pipe walls.</p></div></div></div></div></section>", "contact": "<section class=\"relative py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-border\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 mb-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-primary\"></span>Flow-Direct Intake</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]\">Request a dispatch.</h2></div><p class=\"md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground self-end\">Three technical questions and your contact details. The more we know about the line, the faster we can configure pressure and nozzle for the job.</p></div><form aria-label=\"Hydro jetting dispatch request form\" class=\"grid gap-px bg-border border border-border\" data-lead-form=\"\" id=\"trotwood-hydro-jetting-pros-Form\" name=\"trotwood-hydro-jetting-pros-Form\"><input aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"website\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%);\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/><input aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"email\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%);\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/><input aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"page_code\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%);\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"HSP\"/><input aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"page_location\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%);\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"index\"/><input aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"page_site\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%);\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"Trotwood Hydro Jetting Pros\"/><fieldset class=\"bg-background p-6 lg:p-8\"><legend class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-4\">01 / Residential or Commercial?</legend><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><button aria-label=\"Property type: Residential\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest transition-all border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"Property type\" type=\"button\">Residential</button><button aria-label=\"Property type: Commercial\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest transition-all border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"Property type\" type=\"button\">Commercial</button></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"bg-background p-6 lg:p-8\"><legend class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-4\">02 / System Type?</legend><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><button aria-label=\"System type: Sewer Main\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest transition-all border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"System type\" type=\"button\">Sewer Main</button><button aria-label=\"System type: Kitchen Drain\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest transition-all border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"System type\" type=\"button\">Kitchen Drain</button><button aria-label=\"System type: Bath / Shower\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest transition-all border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"System type\" type=\"button\">Bath / Shower</button><button aria-label=\"System type: Storm Line\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest transition-all border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"System type\" type=\"button\">Storm Line</button></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"bg-background p-6 lg:p-8\"><legend class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-4\">03 / Urgency Level?</legend><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><button aria-label=\"Urgency level: Routine\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-left transition-all border-border hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"Urgency level\" type=\"button\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground\">Routine</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Slow drain, maintenance</div></button><button aria-label=\"Urgency level: Same-Day\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-left transition-all border-border hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"Urgency level\" type=\"button\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground\">Same-Day</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Active backup, partial</div></button><button aria-label=\"Urgency level: Emergency\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"p-4 border text-left transition-all border-border hover:border-primary/50\" data-intake-choice=\"Urgency level\" type=\"button\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground\">Emergency</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Full stop / overflow</div></button></div></fieldset><div class=\"bg-background p-6 lg:p-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><div><label class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2 block\" for=\"name\">Name</label><input aria-label=\"Your name\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-border py-2 text-foreground focus:border-primary outline-none transition-colors\" id=\"name\" name=\"full_name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2 block\" for=\"phone\">Phone</label><input aria-label=\"Your phone number\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-border py-2 text-foreground focus:border-primary outline-none transition-colors\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required=\"\" type=\"tel\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><label class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2 block\" for=\"details\">Line Details (optional)</label><textarea aria-label=\"Optional line details\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-b border-border py-2 text-foreground focus:border-primary outline-none transition-colors resize-none\" id=\"details\" name=\"page_details\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"bg-background p-6 lg:p-8\"><button aria-label=\"Submit dispatch request\" class=\"group w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold px-6 py-5 rounded-sm hover:pressure-glow transition-all disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" disabled=\"\" type=\"submit\"><svg class=\"lucide lucide-send h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg>Submit Dispatch Request</button><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mt-4 text-center\">Select all three technical answers to enable submission</p></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" role=\"status\"></div></form></div></section>"}